                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb5163f1-2847-3c18-b831-f0f4185826f0",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5010b9-6ff6-3f3c-9a2c-bcbd41b2c78e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instrument of attack or defense in combat or hunting, e.g. most guns, missiles, or swords."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d8a851a-6280-4ace-9008-447a3546c504",
                                                "sense_id": "eb5163f1-2847-3c18-b831-f0f4185826f0",
                                                "text": "The club that is now mostly used for golf was once a common weapon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2c4d17e-9f95-4bd2-b437-a690c49b300e",
                                                "sense_id": "eb5163f1-2847-3c18-b831-f0f4185826f0",
                                                "text": "Whether modern, industrial man is less or more warlike than his hunter-gatherer ancestors is impossible to determine.[…]One thing that is true, though, is that murder rates have fallen over the centuries, as policing has spread and the routine carrying of weapons has diminished. Modern society may not have done anything about war. But peace is a lot more peaceful."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0686e1c-b7b7-3d9a-9bfb-6df0053da0fa",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5010b9-6ff6-3f3c-9a2c-bcbd41b2c78e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instrument or other means of harming or exerting control over another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85be0fae-0031-4fbc-888e-1f0fed158471",
                                                "sense_id": "c0686e1c-b7b7-3d9a-9bfb-6df0053da0fa",
                                                "text": "Money is the main weapon of modern oligarchs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb981520-c308-4881-bfce-c01a6e5f1f96",
                                                "sense_id": "c0686e1c-b7b7-3d9a-9bfb-6df0053da0fa",
                                                "text": "“[…] it is not fair of you to bring against mankind double weapons ! Dangerous enough you are as woman alone, without bringing to your aid those gifts of mind suited to problems which men have been accustomed to arrogate to themselves.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fde257d-1b74-47b7-bb7b-7afe2b33a469",
                                                "sense_id": "c0686e1c-b7b7-3d9a-9bfb-6df0053da0fa",
                                                "text": "Rory Delap's long throw-ins are a familiar weapon to the Potters' opponents but this does not make them any easier to defend against."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "07ea3fbd-2f20-32f6-9239-6244e4268cf4",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5010b9-6ff6-3f3c-9a2c-bcbd41b2c78e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tool of any kind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "humorous",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57b5bf4e-43b3-457c-901b-4dfb15688bba",
                                                "sense_id": "07ea3fbd-2f20-32f6-9239-6244e4268cf4",
                                                "text": "Choose your weapon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91b87ff6-fe17-327b-8851-70ab2451f53b",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5010b9-6ff6-3f3c-9a2c-bcbd41b2c78e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An idiot, an oaf, a fool, a tool; a contemptible or incompetent person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "119f6072-de9e-345a-8c05-38f948dc3cf2",
                                        "entry_id": "5f5010b9-6ff6-3f3c-9a2c-bcbd41b2c78e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very skilled, competent, or capable person or thing worthy of awe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a192963-e448-4d40-b0ad-d109d626007f",
                                                "sense_id": "119f6072-de9e-345a-8c05-38f948dc3cf2",
                                                "text": "It has a whopping 5.4-litre V8, with a supercharger bolted to the top of it to help low-end pulling power. In short, it's a weapon and will happily dust a Porsche as easy as brushing your teeth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62cc89ab-e493-42f5-925a-7573338acd2a",
                                                "sense_id": "119f6072-de9e-345a-8c05-38f948dc3cf2",
                                                "text": "We played Endless Heights' record release show earlier this year and during their set Christian from Endless Heights' lung collapsed, but he finished the set like an absolute weapon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf1f1825-b991-4c21-9548-c07d8acff796",
                                                "sense_id": "119f6072-de9e-345a-8c05-38f948dc3cf2",
                                                "text": "I adore her in Easter Parade and Meet Me in St. Louis, but my favourite performance of hers is her concert at [New York’s] Carnegie Hall. She’s a total weapon on that stage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83f5b450-f0b9-47f9-aa03-cbea15d1de8d",
                                                "sense_id": "119f6072-de9e-345a-8c05-38f948dc3cf2",
                                                "text": "American teenager Caroline Marks was trotting across the sand on her dream day at North Narrabeen when Luke Egan called out to her: \"You weapon!\" [...] Egan was mentoring Marks in between commentary stints. He was one of the people to chair the weapon up the beach, calling out to her: \"What did I tell you!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74287c04-01f4-3ad8-83eb-b9ebb045e706",
