                                                "sense_id": "74287c04-01f4-3ad8-83eb-b9ebb045e706",
                                                "text": "Young motherfucking legend, niggas just pretending\nI spit my shit, infectious, don't come in my section\nOr get wet bitch with that weapon\nLift the pussy, yeah I bench press it, and I been stressing since a adolescent"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b53728b-ecf9-4d37-9a58-6dfd8e0c08a8",
                                                "sense_id": "74287c04-01f4-3ad8-83eb-b9ebb045e706",
                                                "text": "Weh you get da pussy deh from?\nHey, gyal me love you\nMd love the way you use your weapon\nGyal, your pussy tight like a vice grip"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "957771e6-ca7f-4dd1-b51d-a22cdba0aa91",
